 "discovery_notes": "BoxLunch 2017 sweep, 27 standard search-snippet queries, building on B024. Feb 2017 wave split into per-film subsets under B024's set key (Peter Pan, Snow White, Little Mermaid, Beauty and the Beast, Up, Bambi, Dumbo, Toy Story, Alice) from the DPB roundup; BoxLunch listings 10831661-10831677 matched by title, $14.90 price and adjacent item numbers only (undated). No set members named by any snippet, so no member pins created. New pins: GotG Awesome Mix cassette (Aug 2017) and a weak Buzz Lightyear Christmas pin from a DPB archive label (Dec 2017). No maker named for any 2017 BoxLunch item."
